         BZ    ACMNEDF        NOT LOADED: 800-BYTE ONLY        XA0056DK         
         LR    R2,R15         THE DIAG 24 WORD                 XA0056DK         
         LA    R0,1           FUNCTION 1: CHK                  XA0056DK         
         LR    R1,R11         THE ADT                          XA0056DK         
         LR    R15,R14                                         XA0056DK         
         BALR  R14,R15                                         XA0056DK         
         C     R15,=F'255'    NOT AN EDF DISK?                 XA0056DK         
         BE    ACMNEDF0                                        XA0056DK         
         STC   R15,ERRCOD0    0, 4 (R/O), OR AN ERROR          XA0056DK         
